{
  "scenes": {
    "S1": {
      "duration": 19.799,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Your phone rings.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.048
        },
        {
          "text": "A man from your bank says your account will be blocked in one hour, unless you read him a code.",
          "start": 2.848,
          "end": 9.151
        },
        {
          "text": "People lose their savings to calls like this.",
          "start": 9.701,
          "end": 13.078
        },
        {
          "text": "Knowing the advice is not the same as practicing it.",
          "start": 13.628,
          "end": 17.403
        },
        {
          "text": "This is Scam Gym.",
          "start": 17.953,
          "end": 19.799
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 18,
      "wpm": 158
    },
    "S2": {
      "duration": 20.682,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This is the bank call.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.297
        },
        {
          "text": "He sounds official, sets a deadline, and tries to scare me.",
          "start": 3.297,
          "end": 7.57
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm busy and worried, so I give my date of birth.",
          "start": 8.77,
          "end": 12.453
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he asks for the code, and I read it out.",
          "start": 13.653,
          "end": 16.799
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is where the money would be gone.",
          "start": 17.999,
          "end": 20.682
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 24,
      "wpm": 179
    },
    "S3": {
      "duration": 19.193,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then the part that matters.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.458
        },
        {
          "text": "Scam Gym walks back through the call and names each pressure tactic: fake authority, a deadline, fear, fake proof.",
          "start": 3.058,
          "end": 11.992
        },
        {
          "text": "Each one comes with a plain explanation, and the safer reply that was there all along.",
          "start": 12.692,
          "end": 19.193
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 18,
      "wpm": 136
    },
    "S4": {
      "duration": 13.156,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Same call, handled well.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.609
        },
        {
          "text": "I hang up and call the number on my card.",
          "start": 3.409,
          "end": 6.469
        },
        {
          "text": "Safe exit, and one habit to keep: a real bank never asks for your code.",
          "start": 7.269,
          "end": 13.156
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 14,
      "wpm": 155
    },
    "S5": {
      "duration": 17.881,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Shop owners and POS agents are targeted with fake transfer alerts.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 5.944
        },
        {
          "text": "In this drill, a customer rushes me with an alert message.",
          "start": 6.544,
          "end": 10.783
        },
        {
          "text": "I check my own banking app, not the message.",
          "start": 11.583,
          "end": 14.864
        },
        {
          "text": "A message is not money.",
          "start": 15.764,
          "end": 17.881
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 16,
      "wpm": 141
    },
    "S6": {
      "duration": 15.031,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It runs in English, Spanish and French, by voice or by tapping, and keeps working offline.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 6.864
        },
        {
          "text": "For the cloned-voice call, it helps a family choose a code word, with a message ready to share.",
          "start": 8.065,
          "end": 15.031
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 18,
      "wpm": 151
    },
    "S8": {
      "duration": 20.744,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Everything is fictional.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.307
        },
        {
          "text": "There are no accounts, nothing is stored, and voice is optional.",
          "start": 2.857,
          "end": 7.159
        },
        {
          "text": "One honest limitation: Scam Gym builds a habit under simulated pressure.",
          "start": 7.959,
          "end": 14.186
        },
        {
          "text": "A real caller with a spoofed number may still sound more convincing than any drill.",
          "start": 14.736,
          "end": 20.744
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 18,
      "wpm": 129
    },
    "S9": {
      "duration": 12.656,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Built between October seventeenth and now, with AI coding assistance from Claude Code.",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 7.092
        },
        {
          "text": "Scam Gym.",
          "start": 7.642,
          "end": 9.025
        },
        {
          "text": "Practice the call before the scammer makes it.",
          "start": 9.575,
          "end": 12.656
        }
      ],
      "source": "synthetic",
      "target": 12,
      "wpm": 123
    }
  },
  "with_study": false,
  "voice": "Kokoro (kokoro-onnx v1.0, open-source text-to-speech)"
